WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.283 --> 00:00:13.718
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THIS WEEK, CALIFORNIA

00:00:13.719 --> 00:00:16.454
GOVERNOR GAVIN NEWSOME IS

00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:18.356
EXPECTED TO ASK FOR $1.4 BILLION

00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:20.325
TO FIGHT HOMELESSNESS.

00:00:20.326 --> 00:00:22.294
IT WOULD DO NOTHING TO REDUCE

00:00:22.295 --> 00:00:25.463
THE INCIDENCE OF HOMELESSNESS.

00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:28.199
NOTHING THEY'VE TRIED IN THAT

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:28.800
STATE HAS.

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:31.503
THEY'RE UNWILLING TO FIX THE

00:00:31.504 --> 00:00:31.937
CORE PROBLEM.

00:00:31.938 --> 00:00:34.306
IN SAN FRANCISCO, POLICE IN

00:00:34.307 --> 00:00:35.640
ACTION AGAINST CRIME AND

00:00:35.641 --> 00:00:39.277
VAGRANCY HAS BECOME SO BAD THAT

00:00:39.278 --> 00:00:44.482
LOCALS ARE TURNING TO PRIVATE

00:00:44.483 --> 00:00:45.283
POLICE.

00:00:45.284 --> 00:00:48.420
&gt;&gt; YEAH, HI, CAN I HELP YOU?

00:00:48.421 --> 00:00:51.356
&gt;&gt; MEET TOBY CLEMMONS.

00:00:51.357 --> 00:00:53.458
HE ISN'T AN ORDINARY COP.

00:00:53.459 --> 00:00:55.327
IN FACT, HE'S NOT A COP AT ALL.

00:00:55.328 --> 00:00:58.263
&gt;&gt; WE ARE PAID FOR BY PRIVATE

00:00:58.264 --> 00:00:59.864
BUSINESSES AND MERCHANTS.

00:00:59.865 --> 00:01:02.300
&gt;&gt; WE SPENT TWO HOURS RIDING

00:01:02.301 --> 00:01:04.836
ALONG WITH CLEMMONS AS HE

00:01:04.837 --> 00:01:07.305
FIELDED CALL AFTER CALL, MOSTLY

00:01:07.306 --> 00:01:11.343
ABOUT DRUG ADDICTS LINING THE

00:01:11.344 --> 00:01:11.943
NEIGHBORHOOD SIDEWALKS.

00:01:11.944 --> 00:01:14.479
&gt;&gt; I TALKED HIM AND ENCOURAGED

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.648
HIM TO MOVE.

00:01:16.649 --> 00:01:17.349
&gt;&gt; OUTSIDE THE LIBRARY WHICH

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:18.950
THEY USE AS A DAY SHELTER, HE

00:01:18.951 --> 00:01:21.653
WAS ACCOSTED BY THIS MAN.

00:01:21.654 --> 00:01:24.155
&gt;&gt; PROTESTING HERE IF I WANTED

00:01:24.156 --> 00:01:27.759
TO, RIGHT?

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.795
&gt;&gt; DO YOU THINK --

00:01:30.796 --> 00:01:31.229
[ INAUDIBLE ]

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.999
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE CASTRO DISTRICT

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:34.399
IS RICH.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.535
&gt;&gt; THE RESIDENTS THAT LIVE ON

00:01:37.536 --> 00:01:39.137
THESE STREETS, THEY PAY FOR OUR

00:01:39.138 --> 00:01:39.504
SERVICE.

00:01:39.505 --> 00:01:43.041
&gt;&gt; THE AREA'S RICHEST RESIDENTS

00:01:43.042 --> 00:01:45.610
VOTED TO CREATE A BENEFIT

00:01:45.611 --> 00:01:47.212
DISTRICT, THAT'S BUREAUCRATIC

00:01:47.213 --> 00:01:49.014
JARGON FOR A PRIVATE GOVERNMENT.

00:01:49.015 --> 00:01:51.449
&gt;&gt; SOME OF THE MOST COMMON CALLS

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:53.518
I GET FROM RESIDENTS, SOMEBODY'S

00:01:53.519 --> 00:01:55.754
SETTING UP A TENT IN FRONT OF

00:01:55.755 --> 00:01:56.988
OUR HOUSE.

00:01:56.989 --> 00:01:58.289
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE BENEFIT DISTRICT

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:01.493
PAYS PEOPLE TO PATROL THE

00:02:01.494 --> 00:02:03.728
STREETS, PICK UP TRASH, AND

00:02:03.729 --> 00:02:05.630
REMOVE GRAFFITI.

00:02:05.631 --> 00:02:07.766
&gt;&gt; MOST CITIES THEY WOULD.

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:08.767
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOT SAN FRANCISCO,

00:02:08.768 --> 00:02:10.802
WHERE PROPERTY OWNERS ARE FORCED

00:02:10.803 --> 00:02:13.805
TO PAY MANDATORY FEES TO FINANCE

00:02:13.806 --> 00:02:16.608
SERVICES THE CITY FAILS TO

00:02:16.609 --> 00:02:16.975
PROVIDE.

00:02:16.976 --> 00:02:20.545
&gt;&gt; IT'S THE WORST I'VE EVERY

00:02:20.546 --> 00:02:20.845
SEEN.

00:02:20.846 --> 00:02:21.846
&gt;&gt; Tucker: JOHN RUNS A HOTEL

00:02:21.847 --> 00:02:23.181
NEAR UNION SQUARE.

00:02:23.182 --> 00:02:24.482
HIS NEIGHBORHOOD HAS GOTTEN SO

00:02:24.483 --> 00:02:26.651
BAD THAT HE REPEATEDLY DEALS

00:02:26.652 --> 00:02:29.287
WITH HORRIFIED HOTEL GUESTS.

00:02:29.288 --> 00:02:31.289
&gt;&gt; THEY ARE TROUBLED BY THE

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:31.690
CLEANLINESS.

00:02:31.691 --> 00:02:33.558
THE FACT THAT THEY AT TIMES

00:02:33.559 --> 00:02:34.259
DON'T FEEL SAFE.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:35.727
SEEING PEOPLE WHO ARE SLEEPING

00:02:35.728 --> 00:02:38.463
ON THE SIDEWALKS.

00:02:38.464 --> 00:02:39.564
THEY'RE BAFFLED.

00:02:39.565 --> 00:02:41.166
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOT ALL IN SAN

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.201
FRANCISCO ARE PRIVILEGED ENOUGH

00:02:43.202 --> 00:02:45.603
TO AFFORD PRIVATE POLICING.

00:02:45.604 --> 00:02:48.173
SINCE THE CITY'S PROSECUTORS ARE

00:02:48.174 --> 00:02:51.176
UNWILLING TO ENFORCE THE LAW,

00:02:51.177 --> 00:02:52.043
THERE'S NOT MUCH PATROL

00:02:52.044 --> 00:02:52.911
SPECIALISTS CAN DO.

00:02:52.912 --> 00:02:54.279
&gt;&gt; THEY GO TO THE NEXT CORNER,

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.815
AND THEN YOU HAVE TO MOVE THEM

00:02:56.816 --> 00:02:58.283
AGAIN.

00:02:58.284 --> 00:02:59.184
&gt;&gt; IT DOES GET FRUSTRATING.

00:02:59.185 --> 00:03:01.820
YOU OFFER THEM SERVICES, THEY

00:03:01.821 --> 00:03:03.021
DON'T WANT SERVICES.

00:03:03.022 --> 00:03:04.622
A LOT OF THEM CHOOSE TO BE ON

00:03:04.623 --> 00:03:08.059
THE STREET BECAUSE IT'S A LIFE

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.461
STYLE THEY LIKE.

00:03:09.462 --> 00:03:10.829
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THIS SERIES CONTINUES

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.430
THIS ENTIRE WEEK WITH THINGS AS

00:03:12.431 --> 00:03:13.998
BAD AS THEY ARE THERE.

00:03:13.999 --> 00:03:16.101
YOU MIGHT THINK HOUSING IN SAN

00:03:16.102 --> 00:03:17.502
FRANCISCO MIGHT GET A LITTLE

00:03:17.503 --> 00:03:19.938
CHEAPER, BUT SOMEHOW IT'S GOTTEN

00:03:19.939 --> 00:03:21.239
MORE EXPENSIVE.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.274
ORDINARY PEOPLE WITH JOBS ARE

00:03:23.275 --> 00:03:26.445
TRYING DESPERATE MEASURES.

